msgctxt "84_Supervisor"
msgid "So many police scandals these days... Kamurocho's\\r\ngoing to hell in a handbasket for sure."
msgstr "Estos días ha habido mucha movida policial...\nSeguramente Kamurocho se terminará yendo al infierno."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "96_Subordinate"
msgid "Yeah, rumor has it that some top police figures\\r\nare up to no good. At least that's what they're\\r\nsaying in this tabloid I read."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "108_Supervisor"
msgid "Bah... We slave away at the office all day, and\\r\nthose crooks are living the good life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "120_Subordinate"
msgid "Right? I hear there are even crooked cops here who take\\r\ncuts and bribes from sex shops. That's no better than\\r\nyakuza running the place!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "132_Supervisor"
msgid "Ugh! If I ever come across one of those pricks,\\r\nI'll punch his goddamn lights out!"
msgstr ""

